d rate than the 8 a.m. slot."}]," ","— ","True from the figure, but it does not address the expectation about early slots being worst."]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-1 font-bold text-eng-green-700","children":["B","."]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"italic text-eng-navy-500","children":"The 8 a.m. slot had the lowest unused rate of any time shown, while the two midday slots were highest."}]," ","— ","Correct. It contrasts exactly the hours the expectation was about."]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-1 font-bold text-red-700","children":["C","."]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"italic text-eng-navy-500","children":"Every slot had some unused appointments."}]," ","— ","True and uninformative. It says nothing about which hours performed worse."]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-1 font-bold text-red-700","children":["D","."]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"italic text-eng-navy-500","children":"The unused rate declined between noon and 4 p.m."}]," ","— ","True, but the decline after noon is not what the staff expectation concerned."]}]]}]]]}]]}]
